> GLM API Key

  zcode uses the GLM (Zhipu) provider, which needs an API key.
  Get a key at https://open.bigmodel.cn.
  It will be stored locally in auth.json.

╭GLM API key─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│glm-test-key                                                        │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  Press enter to save
  Press esc to skip
